{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>מסלת</b> — The highway that they show to turn away from evil is their highway. And whoever wishes to guard his soul from death keeps his way, the one fitting for him, which is the way of the commandments."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:23:07.946913867Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}